## Text Formatting

Normal paragraph with **bold**, *italic*, ***bold italic***, ~~strikethrough~~, ==highlight==, __bold__, and _italic_.

Escaped formatting: \*not italic\*, \# not a heading, and \[not a link\].

This is `inline code`, and this is a <mark>highlight using HTML</mark>.

H~2~O and X^2^ if subscript and superscript extensions are supported.

Keyboard shortcut: <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>S</kbd>

Abbreviation: HTML

*[HTML]: HyperText Markup Language

## Paragraphs and Line Breaks

This is the first paragraph.

This is the second paragraph.

This line ends with two spaces.  
This should appear on a new line.

This line uses an HTML break.<br>
This should also appear on a new line.

## Blockquotes

> This is a blockquote.
>
> It can contain multiple paragraphs.
>
> > This is a nested blockquote.
>
> - It can contain lists.
> - And **formatted text**.

