1. Markdown should number them automatically.
1. Like this.

Start from another number:

5. Fifth item
6. Sixth item

## Task Lists

- [x] Completed task
- [ ] Incomplete task
- [x] Task with **bold text**
  - [ ] Nested task
  - [x] Completed nested task

