## Mathematical Expressions

Inline math: $E = mc^2$

Another inline expression: $\sqrt{a^2+b^2}$

Block math:

$$
f(x) = \frac{1}{\sigma\sqrt{2\pi}}
e^{-\frac{1}{2}\left(\frac{x-\mu}{\sigma}\right)^2}
$$

Matrix:

$$
A =
\begin{bmatrix}
1 & 2 \\
3 & 4
\end{bmatrix}
$$

Aligned equations:

$$
\begin{aligned}
a &= b + c \\
x &= y - z
\end{aligned}
$$

## Mermaid Diagrams

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Open Noted] --> B{Create note?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Write Markdown]
    B -->|No| D[Open existing note]
    C --> E[Render preview]
    D --> E
```

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant N as Noted
    participant R as Renderer

    U->>N: Write Markdown
    N->>R: Send source text
    R-->>N: Return rendered HTML
    N-->>U: Display preview
```

```mermaid
classDiagram
    class Note {
        +String title
        +String content
        +save()
        +render()
    }

    class Folder {
        +String name
        +List~Note~ notes
    }

    Folder "1" --> "*" Note
```

## Admonitions and Callouts

